id: adversary-burst-crash-out
name: Crash Out
order: 2
slot: burst
resource: energyburst
resourceLabel: Energy Burst
resourceMax: 99
description: >
  With your back up against a wall, you lose it. You have to beat those pesky protagonists.
text: >
  Crash Out: With your back up against a wall, you lose it. You have to beat those pesky protagonists.
  (1)-[Automatic/Transform, Resource]: Gain PCC stacks of Energy Burst.

---

# Entering it: PCC stacks of Energy Burst ("PCC": the Adversary's Player Character Count, as everywhere).
[automatic/transform, effect 1]
energyburst.stacks += $PCC;
